{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "label": "Configuration reference", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L1-L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every tunable lives on one of four pydantic models; the 'config over constants' convention exists because hardcoded literals in models/tft.py generated four separate tickets."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_precedence_chain", "label": "Settings precedence chain", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L8-L19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CLI flags > env > .env > YAML > defaults. YAML sits deliberately below the environment so a checked-in experiment config stays overridable per-run, and explicit CLI flags applied after load_settings() win over everything. Nested values use a double-underscore delimiter."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_missing_config_is_error", "label": "A missing --config path is an error, not a silent fallback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L21-L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The underlying settings source treats a missing file as 'no values to contribute', so a typo used to train a completely different experiment than the one asked for - and record it in meta.json as such."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_field_docs_from_source", "label": "Field descriptions read out of pyquant/config.py", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L26-L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An explicit Field(description=...) if set, otherwise the # comment attached to that field. Fields with a blank description have no explanation in the source; that gap is reported rather than papered over with invented prose."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_secrets_rule", "label": "Key presence recorded, key values never", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L42-L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Secrets are optional and their absence disables the corresponding enrichment. Presence is recorded in cache fingerprints and meta.json; values never are - not in logs, not in runs.jsonl, not in a fingerprint."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_validation_days", "label": "TrainingConfig.validation_days", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L54-L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Window count is validation_days - max_prediction_length + 1, so a holdout of exactly one horizon yields a single window: five points driving every reported metric plus early stopping and checkpoint selection. That is where the discarded 'directional accuracy 100.0%' came from."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_purge_embargo", "label": "purge_horizon / embargo_days", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L60-L63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Look-ahead control around every split; they shrink the training slice only, never the scored window (invariant 10)."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_target", "label": "TrainingConfig.target (close vs log_return)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L64-L69", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'close' predicts the price level; 'log_return' predicts per-step log returns and reconstructs a price path for display. The default is deliberately conservative, and the choice matters more than any hyperparameter here."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_quantiles_sorted", "label": "TFTConfig.quantiles must be sorted and contain 0.5", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L77-L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Validated rather than assumed: the first and last entries are the lower and upper calibration bounds, so an unsorted list like [0.9, 0.1, 0.5] would silently invert the band with no error. 0.5 must be present because every consumer of a forecast reads a median."}, {"id": "docs_api_configuration_graceful_degradation", "label": "Enrichment flag is a request, not an assertion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L88-L94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A source activates only if enabled and holding the credentials and data it needs; otherwise it degrades gracefully with a logged notice. The contract holds for training and deliberately stops at predict time. use_options gates a display-only fetch - the options snapshot is never a model feature."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "target": "docs_api_configuration_precedence_chain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L8-L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_missing_config_is_error", "target": "docs_api_configuration_precedence_chain", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L21-L24", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_missing_config_is_error", "target": "docs_cli_train", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L16-L24", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_field_docs_from_source", "target": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L26-L31", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "target": "docs_api_configuration_validation_days", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L54-L59", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "target": "docs_api_configuration_purge_embargo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L60-L63", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "target": "docs_api_configuration_target", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L64-L69", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "target": "docs_api_configuration_quantiles_sorted", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L71-L81", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_configuration_reference", "target": "docs_api_configuration_graceful_degradation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L82-L94", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_quantiles_sorted", "target": "docs_cli_forecast", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L77-L81", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_quantiles_sorted", "target": "docs_cli_json_output", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L77-L81", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_graceful_degradation", "target": "docs_cli_options_display_only", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L94", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_graceful_degradation", "target": "docs_api_design_schema_drift_risk", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L88-L92", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_secrets_rule", "target": "docs_cli_doctor", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L42-L44", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_secrets_rule", "target": "docs_api_design_api_key_auth", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L42-L44", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_validation_days", "target": "docs_cli_backtest", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L54-L59", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_configuration_target", "target": "docs_cli_train", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/api/configuration.md", "source_location": "L64-L69", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}